  "notes": [
    "Pseudo-GT = yolo11n (conf>=0.4, imgsz 640) vehicle boxes on the CLEAN seed, copied to the same frame of each structure-preserving Cosmos-Transfer variant (fidelity edge-SSIM pass). It is incomplete (yolo11n misses small/far vehicles), so recall is 'recall of what the base pipeline sees in daylight', and counts above GT are not necessarily FPs.",
    "All methods are yolo11s, conf 0.4, vehicle classes, imgsz 960; before = stock yolo11s; after = yolo11s fine-tuned only on train cameras (i24 p1c1/p1c2 variants + clean seeds); test = held-out camera i24 p1c3 + NYC (different city).",
    "clahe_baseline = stock yolo11s with CLAHE (+gamma lift on dark frames) preprocessing, no training.",
    "Test set is small: 12 variant clips x 93 frames (frames within a clip are highly correlated); held-out clean seeds: 5. Treat per-condition numbers (1-5 clips) as indicative.",
    "Real-clip row (if present) has no ground truth: more detections/frame is suggestive, not proof (could include FPs)."
  ],
